  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GGF Economic Advisor (Programme Funded Role)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The creation of the project-funded Economic Advisor will maintain the current advisory resourcing for the programme when it would otherwise be facing a cut due to some roles being removed from EECAD&#x2019;s baseline following an application to the Voluntary Exit Scheme.
Maintaining the advisory resourcing of the GGF EN programme team will allow effective technical oversight of the delivery of economic projects across the region. Posts in the region will be able to engage more actively with International Finance Institutions including the World Bank and EBRD, as well as government and civil society, influencing the development community, and improving UK visibility and credibility with key stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
